{"title": "Demonspirit Aura", "pageid": 23442, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Demonspirit_Aura", "categories": ["Passive item features", "Passive features", "Toggleable passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp/300px-Generic_Wild_Animal.webp, /w/images/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp/300px-Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Generic_Wild_Animal.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Demonspirit Aura</b> is a toggleable passive feature granted by the <span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abyss_Beckoners\" title=\"Abyss Beckoners\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/38px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/50px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/25px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Abyss_Beckoners\" title=\"Abyss Beckoners\">Abyss Beckoners</a>. They impart <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">damage resistance</a> to the wearer's summons at the risk of driving them <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"mad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">mad</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>The wearer's summoned creatures have <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to all damage except <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a> damage.\n</p><p>At the start of the summoned creatures turn, it must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or be driven <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Mad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">Mad</a>. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dd><span><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><img alt=\"Loading Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/63/Loading_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Toggleable</span></dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Condition:_Demonspirit_Aura\"> Condition: Demonspirit Aura </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-condition\"><strong><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Aura (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/45px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Demonspirit Aura\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Generic_Wild_Animal_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Aura_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Aura (Condition)\">Demonspirit Aura</a></strong>\n<div>\n<ul><li>Affected entity's summoned creature has <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">Resistance</a> to all damage except <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psychic\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Psychic_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/0/04/Psychic_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Psychic\" title=\"Psychic\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-psychic\">Psychic</span></a>.</li>\n<li>At the start of the summoned creature's turn, it must succeed a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"Wisdom Saving Throw\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wisdom\" title=\"Wisdom\">Wisdom</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_Throw\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Saving Throw\">Saving Throw</a> or be driven <a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\">Mad</a>.</li></ul>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by the equipment:</p><ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Abyss_Beckoners\" title=\"Abyss Beckoners\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/9/9b/Gloves_Leather_F_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Abyss_Beckoners\" title=\"Abyss Beckoners\">Abyss Beckoners</a></span></li>\n</ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Though not stated ingame, the aura is visible as a red circle; it emanates from the wearer with a <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/38px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png/25px-Aoe_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/d/d0/Aoe_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> AoE: 9 m (30 ft) Radius.</li>\n<li>Summoned creatures which are otherwise immune to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/47/Charmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Charmed (Condition)\">Charmed</a> (such as <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Calmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Calmed (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/fb/Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Calmed\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fb/Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/fb/Calmed_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Calmed_(Condition)\" title=\"Calmed (Condition)\">Calmed</a> or <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Devotion_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Devotion (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Aura of Devotion\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Aura_of_Devotion_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Aura_of_Devotion_(Condition)\" title=\"Aura of Devotion (Condition)\">Aura of Devotion</a>) cannot go <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Demonspirit_Madness_(Condition)\" title=\"Demonspirit Madness (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/40px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"mad\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp/20px-Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/3/36/Crown_of_Madness_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/